<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mi cotizacion - Chipilines Venezuela</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Pacifico&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<script>
  tailwind.config = { theme: { extend: {
    colors: { rosa: '#E8B4C8', cielo: '#A8D8EA', oro: '#D4AF37', crema: '#FDF8F5', tinta: '#2D2A32' },
    fontFamily: { sans: ['Quicksand','sans-serif'], display: ['Pacifico','cursive'], script: ['Dancing Script','cursive'] }
  }}}
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">

<!-- SEO / Open Graph / Twitter -->
<meta name="description" content="Revisa tu cotizacion y enviala por WhatsApp. Sin pagos online, todo personalizado.">
<meta name="author" content="Chipilines Venezuela">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#E8B4C8">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://tubular-cheesecake-d5c238.netlify.app/carrito.html">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Chipilines Venezuela">
<meta property="og:title" content="Mi cotizacion - Chipilines Venezuela">
<meta property="og:description" content="Revisa tu cotizacion y enviala por WhatsApp. Sin pagos online, todo personalizado.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://tubular-cheesecake-d5c238.netlify.app/carrito.html">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://tubular-cheesecake-d5c238.netlify.app/img/og-chipilines.png">
<meta property="og:locale" content="es_VE">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Mi cotizacion - Chipilines Venezuela">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="Revisa tu cotizacion y enviala por WhatsApp. Sin pagos online, todo personalizado.">
</head>
<body class="bg-crema">
<a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Saltar al contenido principal</a>

<nav class="navbar fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
    <a href="index.html" class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-rosa to-cielo flex items-center justify-center shadow-md"><span class="font-display text-white text-lg">C</span></div>
      <div class="leading-none"><p class="font-bold text-lg tracking-tight">Chipilines</p><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-gray-500">Venezuela</p></div>
    </a>
    <a href="catalogo.html" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 hover:text-tinta transition flex items-center gap-2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 16l-4-4m0 0l4-4m-4 4h18"/></svg>
      Seguir explorando
    </a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="pt-32 pb-8 px-5 md:px-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto reveal">
  <p class="font-script text-3xl text-rosa mb-2">Mi cotizacion</p>
  <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-tinta mb-2">Casi listo</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-500">Revisa tus productos, completa tus datos y envia tu cotizacion por WhatsApp.</p>
</header>

<main id="main-content" class="px-5 md:px-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto pb-24 grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8">
  <section class="lg:col-span-3">
    <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">Productos seleccionados <span id="total-items" class="bg-rosa/20 text-tinta text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">0</span></h2>
    <div id="lista-carrito" class="space-y-3"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="lg:col-span-2">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm sticky top-28">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Tus datos</h2>
      <form id="form-cotizacion" onsubmit="enviarCotizacion(event)" class="space-y-4">
        <div><label class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1 block">Nombre completo *</label>
          <input id="cli-nombre" type="text" required class="w-full bg-crema rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rosa/40" placeholder="Ej: Maria Perez"></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div><label class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1 block">Cedula *</label>
            <input id="cli-cedula" type="text" required class="w-full bg-crema rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rosa/40" placeholder="V-12345678"></div>
          <div><label class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1 block">Telefono *</label>
            <input id="cli-telefono" type="tel" required class="w-full bg-crema rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rosa/40" placeholder="+58 412..."></div>
        </div>
        <div><label class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1 block">Fecha del evento (opcional)</label>
          <input id="cli-evento" type="text" class="w-full bg-crema rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rosa/40" placeholder="Ej: 15 de diciembre"></div>
        <div><label class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1 block">Notas adicionales</label>
          <textarea id="cli-notas" rows="3" class="w-full bg-crema rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rosa/40 resize-none" placeholder="Colores, medidas, tematica, nombres exactos..."></textarea></div>
        <div class="bg-cielo/20 rounded-2xl p-4 text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Al enviar, abriremos WhatsApp con tu cotizacion lista. No se realiza ningun pago en esta pagina.</div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-wsp w-full font-bold py-3.5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893A11.821 11.821 0 0020.464 3.488"/></svg>
          Enviar cotizacion por WhatsApp
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script src="js/app.js"></script>
<script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', renderCarrito);</script>
</body>
</html>
